# Feature hooks

Put a feature's custom React hooks in `src/features/<feature>/hooks/`. Name the file after the hook: `use-building-selection.ts` exports `useBuildingSelection`.

```ts
// src/features/cpq/hooks/use-building-selection.ts
export function useBuildingSelection() { /* configuration and share state */ }
```

Components import these hooks. Do not leave a feature's client state and effects inline in a component when they are their own hook. Do not put hooks in `utils/` or `components/`. Hooks call `server/actions.ts` for writes. They do not import `db/` or `server/queries.ts`.
